# Reserved for future service configuration. Do not add secrets to this file.

# Live text generation requires GEMINI_API_KEY in the trusted deployment.
# GEMINI_TEXT_MODEL defaults to gemini-3.8-flash. Demo mode needs no secrets.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL and UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN optionally add a
# deployment-wide request limiter; Vercel KV's KV_REST_API_URL and
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN names are also supported.
# Voice requires ELEVENLABS_API_KEY and the durable Upstash limiter above.
# ELEVENLABS_TRANSCRIBE_MODEL defaults to scribe_v3.
# ELEVENLABS_SPEECH_MODEL defaults to eleven_flash_v2_5.
# Optional voice overrides: ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ALLOY_ID,
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_CORAL_ID, and ELEVENLABS_VOICE_SAGE_ID.
